# Only needed for the M6 MST testnet deploy -- never for local (M1) work.
# The team fills this in and runs the deploy command themselves; this
# agent never reads, writes, or sources this file.
#
# IMPORTANT: Hardhat 3's `configVariable(...)` (used for MST_RPC and
# DEPLOYER_KEY in hardhat.config.ts) reads straight from `process.env` --
# there is no dotenv auto-load. Copying this to `contracts/.env` alone
# does nothing. Before `--network mst`, either:
#   - export the variables below in your shell, e.g.
#       export MST_RPC=https://testnetrpc.mstblockchain.com
#       export DEPLOYER_KEY=0x...
#   - or store the key encrypted instead of in plaintext:
#       npx hardhat keystore set DEPLOYER_KEY
#     (from hardhat-keystore, already in this project's toolbox) and just
#     export MST_RPC.

MST_RPC=https://testnetrpc.mstblockchain.com
DEPLOYER_KEY=
